# E214 — uncompressed single-file release asset treated as an archive

id:                     E271
trigger_tool: runtime
phase: configuration
error_signature: not a gzip file|tar: Not tar|gzip: .* not in gzip format
severity: 2
category: source-packaging
match_keywords: not a gzip file,tar Not tar,single-file release asset,uncompressed release asset
title: Uncompressed single-file release asset is treated as an archive

root_cause: The official release URL serves one uncompressed executable script without an archive suffix, while generic source initialization infers an archive format and invokes gzip or tar on the plain file.
affected_scope: Projects whose official release artifact is an uncompressed executable or script rather than a source archive.
verification_cmd: sha256sum tool && bash -n tool && bash tool --version

rec_priority: high
rec_approach: Use a custom Conan application recipe to download the official single-file asset with SHA256 verification, validate it directly, and install it under package/bin without extraction.
rec_description: Treat the release artifact as a verified file instead of an archive.
rec_command: download(self, url=source["url"], filename="tool", sha256=source["sha256"])
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual-conan-single-file-download

fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: If upstream also publishes a canonical source archive, switch conandata.yml to that official archive and use the matching build recipe.
fallback_description: Use an official source archive only when upstream provides one for the same release.
fallback_command: Verify the alternate official asset URL and SHA256 before updating conandata.yml.
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: manual-official-archive-selection

forbid_1_pattern: conan\.tools\.files\.get\(|tar\s|gzip\s
forbid_1_reason: Archive extraction must not be applied to a confirmed uncompressed single-file asset.
forbid_1_consequence: The source step fails before packaging with gzip or tar format errors.
forbid_2_pattern: gh-proxy|ghproxy|gitclone|moeyy|kkgithub
forbid_2_reason: Recipe metadata must retain the official upstream URL; CI owns mirror fallback injection.
forbid_2_consequence: Proxy URLs remain in the delivered conandata.yml and violate R39 provenance requirements.

principles:             P013

causes: []
caused_by: []
similar_to: []
conflicts_with: []
prerequisite_of: []

doc_file:               doc/E271.md
last_updated: 2026-07-13
source_event: bashunit/0.40.0 init-build failed because the official single-file release asset was passed to gzip extraction.

